---
import { Lock } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<aside class="cs-confidentiality" aria-label="Nota de confidencialidad">
	<div class="cs-confidentiality__inner">
		<div class="cs-confidentiality__note">
			<p class="cs-confidentiality__label"><Lock class="cs-confidentiality__icon" aria-hidden="true" />Nota de confidencialidad</p>
			<p class="cs-confidentiality__text">
				Algunas imágenes de este caso de estudio han sido modificadas o recreadas para proteger información confidencial. Se incluyen como apoyo visual para explicar el proceso y las decisiones de diseño.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.cs-confidentiality__inner {
		box-sizing: border-box;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: calc(1440px * var(--ui-scale));
		margin-inline: auto;
		padding: calc(24px * var(--ui-scale)) calc(64px * var(--ui-scale)) calc(48px * var(--ui-scale));
	}
	/* Reads as an aside, not content: accent rule on the left, no fill,
	   limited to the reading column. */
	.cs-confidentiality__note {
		max-width: calc(680px * var(--ui-scale));
		padding-left: calc(20px * var(--ui-scale));
		border-left: 2px solid var(--color-action-ghost-text);
	}
	/* Same type as CaseCallout's title. */
	.cs-confidentiality__label {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: var(--space-2);
		margin: 0 0 calc(8px * var(--ui-scale));
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: calc(12px * var(--ui-scale));
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.75;
		letter-spacing: calc(4px * var(--ui-scale));
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 90%, transparent);
	}
	.cs-confidentiality__icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: calc(16px * var(--ui-scale));
		height: calc(16px * var(--ui-scale));
		color: var(--color-action-ghost-text);
	}
	.cs-confidentiality__text {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: max(14px, calc(17px * var(--ui-scale)));
		font-style: italic;
		line-height: 1.65;
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
	}
	@media (max-width: 839px) {
		.cs-confidentiality__inner {
			padding-inline: var(--gutter-mobile);
		}
	}
</style>
